Subject: [PATCH 20/20] test(claude-eval): G214-3 isolated worker acceptance:
 reference worker and 12 contract scenarios

Plan -> verify (canonical re-read and profile rights) -> act. Deletions are only
proposed; abandonment and integrity alerts go to review; indexed() only after
index read-back. Scenarios: unreadable canon, proven absence, reappearing
document, crashes between write steps and between upsert and indexed(), index
unavailable, canon moving after plan, superseded revisions, missing rights,
busy lock. Each guard verified by mutation (re-read, rights, deletion,
read-back removed: the matching tests fail).

